    <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-controls="navigation" aria-expanded="false">菜单</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>广州 / 中国</span>
      <span>视觉策划 &amp; 资深视觉设计</span>
      <span>Portfolio — 2026</span>
    </div>
    <h1>LUSON<sup>©</sup></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">陈柳任 / Creative Studio</span>
        <h2>把商业目标转译成<br>有温度的视觉体验。</h2>
        <span class="eyebrow">Art direction · Visual strategy · AIGC</span>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-art">
        <img src="https://liuren-visual-studio.lusonchan.chatgpt.site/assets/manifesto-sphere.png"
             alt="浅绿色内核的三维球体" fetchpriority="high">
      </figure>
      <div class="hero-side">
        <p>以视觉策划驱动品牌表达，<br>让创意回应商业目标。</p>
        <a class="pill" href="#work">探索作品集</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-foot">
      <span>独立思考，完整表达。</span>
      <a href="#about">向下探索</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label"><span>01</span><span>关于我 / ABOUT</span></div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>我是一名专注于<br><em>视觉策划 / 品牌落地 / 数据分析</em><br>AI 赋能型的资深视觉猎手</h2>
          <p>从电商视觉到品牌系统，从平面构成到 AI 影像。我喜欢在商业和实验之间找到新的平衡，让每一个触点都变得清晰、有力、值得记住。</p>
          <a class="pill" href="#contact">联系我聊聊</a>
        </div>
        <div class="portrait">
          <img src="https://liuren-visual-studio.lusonchan.chatgpt.site/assets/luson-waist-avatar.webp"
               alt="陈柳任的动漫半身头像" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact">
          <strong><span data-count="10" style="display:inline;font:inherit;color:inherit">10</span>+ 年</strong>
          <span>设计与项目管理经验</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <strong><span data-count="300" style="display:inline;font:inherit;color:inherit">300</span>W+</strong>
          <span>站酷人气设计师</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <strong>全品类</strong>
          <span>电商 · 品牌 · 网页 · AIGC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="experience-scope">
        <div>
          <h3>跨境电商</h3>
          <p>独立站、亚马逊、TEMU、TikTok（TK）等平台。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>国内电商</h3>
          <p>天猫、京东、拼多多、得物、小红书等主流平台。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>设计品类</h3>
          <p>服装、饰品、手表、箱包、3C、户外电池、日化品等。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="honors">
        <div>
          <h3>站酷推荐设计师</h3>
          <p>68designn 推荐设计师<br>中国品牌设计中心官推设计师<br>站酷中国设计大奖评审</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="honor-number">2<small>次</small></div>
          <p>作品获得站酷总榜第 1 名</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="honor-number">3<small>次</small></div>
          <p>作品获得网页榜第 1 名</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="experience" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label"><span>02</span><span>工作经历 / EXPERIENCE</span></div>
      <h2 class="section-title">A decade <span class="serif">of design.</span></h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <time>2025.12 — 至今</time>
          <div>
            <h3>广州桓灿服饰有限公司</h3>
            <p>负责服饰品牌的视觉策划与美术指导，统筹创意方向、画面表达及设计落地。</p>
          </div>
          <span class="role">美术指导 / 视觉策划</span>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <time>2024.05 — 2025.09</time>
          <div>
            <h3>广州花与时电子有限公司</h3>
            <p>负责综合电商视觉与美术指导，梳理产品卖点，统一店铺及营销内容的视觉表达。</p>
          </div>
          <span class="role">美术指导 / 综合电商</span>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <time>2022.12 — 2024.04</time>
          <div>
            <h3>波罗蜜科技（广州）有限公司</h3>
            <p>负责跨境电商设计与团队协作，围绕商品展示和营销场景推进视觉制作。</p>
          </div>
          <span class="role">设计主管 / 跨境电商</span>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <time>2020.10 — 2022.11</time>
          <div>
            <h3>鲁森视觉设计（广州）有限公司</h3>
            <p>负责客户项目的设计统筹，衔接创意方案、视觉执行与交付。</p>
          </div>
          <span class="role">设计主管 / 设计乙方</span>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <time>2015.07 — 2020.09</time>
          <div>
            <h3>广州文豆网络科技有限公司</h3>
            <p>负责设计教学与课程组织，结合项目实践开展教学及团队管理。</p>
          </div>
          <span class="role">讲师 / 经理</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="work" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label"><span>03</span><span>精选作品 / SELECTED WORK</span></div>
      <div class="work-heading">
        <h2 class="section-title">Selected <span class="serif">works.</span></h2>
        <span class="eyebrow" id="project-count"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="作品分类"></div>
      <div class="projects" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="empty" hidden>该分类暂无已展示作品，请浏览其他分类。</p>
      <nav class="pagination" aria-label="作品分页"></nav>
      <noscript><p>请启用 JavaScript 查看作品分类与图片。</p></noscript>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="brands" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label"><span>04</span><span>合作品牌 / COLLABORATIONS</span></div>
      <div class="brands">
        <span>SHEIN</span><span>AMAZON</span><span>TMALL</span>
        <span>JD</span><span>TEMU</span><span>HEYFUTURE</span>
        <span>SPACE</span><span>JOYEE</span><span>NEM.</span>
        <span>DUKE</span><span>小红书</span><span>唯品会</span>
        <span>得物</span><span>拼多多</span><span>潮色绘</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement">
    <div class="container statement-inner">
